## 1. Definitions

"Licensor" means Ahmad Ali Parr.

"Software" means the source code, documentation, examples, tests, and other
materials that the Licensor makes available under this license. Separately
licensed third-party materials remain governed by their respective licenses.

"Competing Use" means making the Software available to others in a commercial
product or service that substitutes for the Software, offers the same or
substantially similar functionality as the Software, or substitutes for a
product or service the Licensor offers using the Software as of the date the
applicable version is made available.

"AI Training" means using the Software, any portion of it, modifications or
derivatives of it, or data derived from it as training material for an artificial
intelligence or machine-learning model. This includes pretraining, fine-tuning,
continued training, distillation, reinforcement learning, and constructing or
supplying datasets for any of those purposes. Data derived from the Software
includes synthetic training examples generated from its code or documentation.

"Permitted Purpose" means any purpose that is neither a Competing Use nor AI
Training.

