## 3. No AI training

You may not use the Software for AI Training, or license, sell, distribute, or
otherwise supply it or data derived from it for AI Training, without separate
written permission from the Licensor. This restriction applies to commercial,
noncommercial, educational, research, and internal activities alike.

Using an existing AI model solely for inference, such as to review, explain, or
modify the Software, is permitted if that activity is otherwise a Permitted
Purpose and the Software and resulting derived data are not used for AI
Training. This license does not prohibit training on unrelated material or on
your own material that is independent of the Software.

